flowchart TD
    A[Open Electron terminal] --> B[Clear transient Chromium session data]
    B --> C[Load encrypted device key from OS-protected storage]
    C --> D[Request one-time challenge]
    D --> E{Device active and public key provisioned?}
    E -- No --> F[Show sign-in error]
    E -- Yes --> G[Sign nonce in Electron main process]
    G --> H[POST signature to device-login]
    H --> I{Signature valid and challenge unused?}
    I -- No --> F
    I -- Yes --> J[Return 5-minute JWT]
    J --> K[Keep token in React memory]
    K --> L[Show terminal modules]
    L --> M{Operator action}
    M --> N[Save today's rates]
    M --> O[Register/search customer]
    M --> P[Submit debt payment]
    N --> Q[Protected API verifies JWT and active device]
    O --> Q
    P --> Q
    Q --> R{Authorized?}
    R -- No --> S[Clear React session and Chromium storage]
    R -- Yes --> T[Read or update PostgreSQL]
    T --> U[Return JSON and rotated token]
    U --> V[Update in-memory view/session]
    T -. Payment error .-> W[Rollback payment transaction]
    W --> X[Show actionable error]
    S --> X
